#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Play Options"
msgstr "Opcións de Reproducción"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid " seconds"
msgstr " segundos"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "1 second"
msgstr "1 segundo"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid ""
"This option controls the number of seconds KsCD will skip when the skip "
"forwards or backwards buttons are pressed."
msgstr "Esta opción especifica o número de segundos que KsCD saltará cando se preman os botóns saltar adiante e saltar atrás."

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Skip &interval:"
msgstr "Saltar &intervalo:"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Auto&play when CD inserted"
msgstr "Auto&reproducir cando se inserta un CD"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid ""
"When this option is selected the CD will start playing automatically upon "
"being inserted into the CD-ROM."
msgstr "Cando se selecciona esta opción o CD reproducirase automáticamente despois de insertalo na unidade."

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "&Eject CD when finished playing"
msgstr "&Expulsa-lo CD cando remate a reproducción"

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid ""
"When this option is selected the CD will automatically eject when it is "
"finished."
msgstr "Cando esta opción está seleccionada o CD expúlsase automáticamente cando remata a reproducción."

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "Stop playing CD on exit"
msgstr "Deixar de reproduci-lo CD ó sair"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid ""
"When this option is selected the CD will automatically stop playing when "
"quitting KsCD."
msgstr "Cando esta opción está seleccionada o CD deixase de reproducir automáticamente cando se pecha o KsCD."

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "CD-ROM &Device"
msgstr "Uni&dade de CD-ROM"

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid ""
"The CD-ROM device to use when playing CDs. This will typically look "
"something like \"/dev/cdrom\". To have KsCD autodetect your CD-ROM, leave "
"this field empty."
msgstr "A unidade a usar para reproducir CDs. Normalmente é algo semellante a \"/*dev/cdrom\". Para que KsCD detecte automáticamente o CD-ROM, deixe baleiro este campo."

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "Selec&t audio device:"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid "&Use direct digital playback"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid ""
"When this option is selected KsCD will attempt to play the CD using direct "
"digital playback. This option is useful if the CD-ROM is not connected "
"directly to the sound output on the computer. Note that digital playback is "
"slower than the normal method of playback."
msgstr ""

